{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{TAGLINE}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Private therapy and coaching for adults navigating anxiety, transitions, relationships and burnout in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Confidential, goal-focused care." />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container nav-wrap">
      <a class="brand" href="/">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
      <nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Primary Navigation">
        <a href="about.html">Work With Me</a>
        <a href="specialties.html">Specialties</a>
        <a href="approach.html">Approach</a>
        <a href="fees.html">Investment</a>
        <a href="faq.html">Questions</a>
        <a href="book.html" class="primary">Start</a>
        <button id="menuToggle" class="menu-btn" aria-expanded="false">Menu</button>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero gallery-hero" id="hero">
      <div class="hero-media">
        <img src="assets/img/hero.svg" alt="Abstract therapy gallery illustration" />
      </div>
      <div class="hero-content container">
        <h1 class="hero-title">Calm, clear care for the next chapter.</h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">I blend experiential therapy and strategic coaching to help you move from overwhelm to sustainable change. Sessions in-person in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} and online.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <button class="btn ghost" id="leadMagnetBtn">Get a Free Clarity Guide</button>
        </div>
        <p class="small-meta">Sessions with {{THERAPIST_NAME}}, {{LICENSE}}. Confidential care. See footer for scope and crisis guidance.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="values container" id="values">
      <h2 class="section-title">How I work — grounded values</h2>
      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Attuned presence</h3>
          <p>I listen for patterns and priorities, then tailor an approach that respects your rhythm and pace.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Evidence-informed</h3>
          <p>Techniques draw on cognitive-behavioral, somatic, and narrative approaches to support measurable progress.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Practical focus</h3>
          <p>We build skills you can use between sessions — concrete practices that translate to everyday life.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="methods gallery" id="methods">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Methods & modalities</h2>
        <p class="lede">Work is integrative and tailored. Typical modalities include:</p>
        <ul class="modalities">
          <li>{{MODALITIES}}</li>
          <li>CBT (cognitive behavioral tools)</li>
          <li>Somatic regulation and grounding</li>
          <li>Relational work for couples and attachment themes</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="note">If you have a modality preference or access needs, mention it when you book and we will accommodate where possible.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="objections container" id="objections">
      <h2 class="section-title">Common hesitations — and honest answers</h2>
      <div class="qa-grid">
        <div class="qa">
          <h4>"I don’t know if therapy will help me."</h4>
          <p>That’s a reasonable concern. We begin with clear goals and short-term check-ins so you can assess benefit early on. Therapy is a collaboration with measurable steps.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="qa">
          <h4>"I’m too busy for weekly sessions."</h4>
          <p>Many clients start with every-other-week or brief check-ins while building skills. We design a rhythm that fits your life.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="qa">
          <h4>"Won’t therapy just rehash my past?"</h4>
          <p>We aim to make the past understandable in service of present change — focusing on patterns that matter now and pragmatic tools for the future.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="testimonials gallery-bg" id="testimonials">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Client reflections</h2>
        <div class="testi-grid">
          <blockquote class="testimonial">
            <p>"Working together gave me a clear path forward. The sessions were practical and compassionate — I started sleeping better within weeks."</p>
            <footer>- A. from {{CITY}}</footer>
          </blockquote>

          <blockquote class="testimonial">
            <p>"I appreciated the structure and tools. I felt respected and challenged in the best way."</p>
            <footer>- N. in {{STATE}}</footer>
          </blockquote>

          <div class="avatar-wrap">
            <img src="assets/img/avatar.svg" alt="Therapist avatar" />
            <p class="byline">Sessions with {{THERAPIST_NAME}}, {{LICENSE}}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lead-magnet container" id="lead">
      <h2 class="section-title">Free clarity guide</h2>
      <p>Download a short workbook to clarify goals and try three practical regulation exercises before your first session.</p>
      <form id="leadForm" class="lead-form" aria-label="Lead magnet sign-up">
        <label for="leadEmail" class="sr-only">Email</label>
        <input id="leadEmail" name="email" type="email" placeholder="Your email" required />
        <button type="submit" class="btn primary">Send the guide</button>
      </form>
      <p class="small-meta">We never sell your info. By signing up you consent to occasional emails related to your request. Confidentiality practices apply — see footer.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="final-cta gallery-cta" id="cta">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Ready to begin?</h2>
        <p>If you’re looking for clear, compassionate work that fits your life, let’s talk.</p>
        <a class="btn primary large" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="contact.html">Contact & availability</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container footer-grid">
      <div>
        <h4>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h4>
        <p>{{THERAPIST_NAME}}, {{LICENSE}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</p>
        <p><a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h5>Practice notes</h5>
        <p>All conversations are confidential except where disclosure is required by law (risk of harm, mandated reporting). This practice provides psychotherapy and coaching support; psychotherapy scope excludes emergency crises.</p>
        <p class="disclaimer">If you are in immediate danger or experiencing a mental health emergency, call local emergency services or a crisis line immediately.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h5>Resources</h5>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="about.html">About & approach</a></li>
          <li><a href="fees.html">Fees & insurance</a></li>
          <li><a href="faq.html">Frequently asked</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="legal">
      <p>&copy; <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}}. All rights reserved. Licensed clinician: {{THERAPIST_NAME}}, {{LICENSE}}.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
